---
source: xtask/src/help.rs
expression: help_for(&path)
---
Stage the book and serve it at http://127.0.0.1:3000/ with mdbook serve, until interrupted; run it again after editing a page (links are checked by docs build)

Usage: cargo xtask docs serve [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --port <n>
          The port to listen on, 1024 to 65535 (default 3000)

      --open
          Open the book in a browser

  -h, --help
          Print help
